  "title": "Bit Digital, Inc. Announces Confidential Submission of Draft Registration Statement for Proposed Initial Public Offering of WhiteFiber Inc.",
  "summary": "Bit Digital, Inc. (Nasdaq: BTBT), today announced that its wholly-owned HPC subsidiary, WhiteFiber Inc. (“WhiteFiber”), has confidentially submitted a draft registration statement on Form S-1 with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (the “SEC”) relating to the proposed initial public offering of WhiteFiber’s ordinary shares.",
